  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1bTFJSYunrwA7bgZY3R-9JbwBnkYgHSTU1jmSFeUKavE/edit\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1bTFJSYunrwA7bgZY3R-9JbwBnkYgHSTU1jmSFeUKavE/edit</a><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>*사본만들기용 :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1WLiG5eerM5jr86hjVNF1IKfcTzbiEndwT1XDKES1ob8/edit\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1WLiG5eerM5jr86hjVNF1IKfcTzbiEndwT1XDKES1ob8/</a>copy</p><p>과학 행사가 많이 사라져서</p><p>구글 오토드로우를 활용한 온라인을 진행하였습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>원래 환경의날 기념해서 하고싶었는데 늦게 기획하는 바람에.. ㅎㅎ</p><p>6~7월에 걸쳐서 받았습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>우수 학생에게는 대나무 칫솔을 상품으로 줄 예정입니다~~ ^.^</p><p><br></p><p>Autodraw 라는 새로운 기능을 알게 해주고 싶어서 써봤는데 결과물이&nbsp;귀엽네요.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991FB43B5F1A419423\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"580\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"autodraw 7_7_2020 - 1832조우용.png\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_991FB43B5F1A4194233BC9\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991F903B5F1A419423\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"400\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"autodraw 2020. 6. 26. 오후 1_47_11 - 1117조유진.png\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_991F903B5F1A4194236B37\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99205A3B5F1A419623\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"580\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"autodraw 2020. 6. 26. 오후 10_06_04 - 1103김나현.png\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_99205A3B5F1A4196231BB9\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9920853B5F1A419623\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"400\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"autodra